[Options]

[A.]

<h2>Message from Page of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Sacrafice this image of Duke to honor his death...


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>Now take the spell and stand beside our friend's tomb.  Then destroy his temple to unleash his power.  Only then will you receive his power.  Beware, only the strong will make it...

[ai5TempleDead]
<h2>Done!</h2>
<p>
You now have the Duke of Thunder's power, unfortunatly you have lost your knowledge of the wind technology.  May his power help you in your conquest.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron31

[ai6TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Ritual</h2>
<i>"Nothing is without cost"<br>
--Book of Nimbus</i>  
<p>After meeting up with your allies you prepare to receive the Duke's power.  You must be quick however, the Elemental Clan is sure to find you soon.

$Button=Begin the Ritual,DoNothing,0

